abstract: >-
  goat is an opinionated open-source data substrate for sovereign edge
  deployments. It combines identity-based mesh networking, partition-tolerant
  pub/sub, offline-CA enrollment, and phoenix-native peer discipline into
  one substrate with one build tool and one operator CLI.
